      "observed": "Roney Vieira/Norte Energia oblique aerial of the completed principal powerhouse. Deep green continuous roof, concrete headwall and individual silver penstocks with collars, yellow access platforms, long river-facing transformer apron and low outlet bays. The visible pipe count is cropped on the east. The photograph is an authoring reference and contributes no texture pixels."
    },
    {
